Keijiro Kino* effects — MIT / Unlicense Attribution
======================================================

This crate (alice-font, v0.3.2+) incorporates five TextEffect variants
whose parameter schemas are inspired by Keijiro Takahashi's Unity
image effect packages under the "Kino" umbrella.

Absorbed variants (5) with source repository + license:

| TextEffect variant   | Source repo                        | License   |
|----------------------|------------------------------------|-----------|
| Datamosh             | github.com/keijiro/KinoDatamosh    | Unlicense |
| Contour              | github.com/keijiro/KinoContour     | MIT       |
| AnamorphicStreak     | github.com/keijiro/KinoStreak      | MIT       |
| VolumetricFog        | github.com/keijiro/KinoFog         | MIT       |
| Isoline              | github.com/keijiro/KinoIsoline     | MIT       |

The crate itself contains only the `TextEffect::*` enum variants and
serde JSON schemas — the actual fragment shader implementations live
in consuming projects.
Parameter names / units are chosen to align with the Kino originals
but the algorithms are conceptual re-implementations for SDF-based
glyph rendering rather than literal HLSL ports.

